        <activityName xml:lang="en">Chemicals inorganic, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Chemicals inorganic, at plant
An unweighted average of the first 20 inorganic substances, being part of the top100 chemicals and included into this database, is established.;
UUID: 90d675e2-e433-3ef4-abc3-4a6735350d72
A general module for inorganic chemicals is established, based on the modules of several inorganic substances from the ecoinvent database
Location: General module, based on chemicals from Europe, Switzerland and Global level, used as a global average.
Technology: Present technology for the production of the different included chemicals (for details, see datasets of the respective chemical substance)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_90d675e2-e433-3ef4-abc3-4a6735350d72.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
